<title>GERMANY: Fresenius sets nominal 10 mln dmk rights.</title>
<headline>Fresenius sets nominal 10 mln dmk rights.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, April 7, Reuter -</p>
<p>Preference shares</p>
<p>Terms : one new shares for nine already held.</p>
<p>Subscription period : April 30 to May 15 1997</p>
<p>Number of new shares : Two million</p>
<p>Price of new shares : five marks</p>
<p>Nominal capital increased by 10 million marks to 100 million marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Fresenius AG. The management board of the German medical products group said it planned to use the money for further expansion of the company.</p>
</text>
